🔧 How to Use
Burn Raspberry Pi OS to your SD card.

Clone your repository to /home/pi/wro_future_engineers_2026:

bash
git clone https://github.com/robotahmid07-debug/WRO-2026-Future-Engineers-Team-Obsidian.git /home/pi/wro_future_engineers_2026
Run the installer:

bash
cd /home/pi/wro_future_engineers_2026
chmod +x scripts/install_dependencies.sh
./scripts/install_dependencies.sh
